//   blocker  characters walk around it        glow  a soft light after dark { color, size, y, flicker }
//   layer    floor (furniture) · rug (under furniture) · top (on a table) · wall (hangs on a wall, indoors)
//   surface  tables: height of the top in blocks       indoor  only inside your house
